# AI-assisted development · Coding Rules

> Read the applicable collaboration and architecture sections when planning or implementing engineering work. Reuse unchanged reading on continuation under the project `AGENTS.md` router.
>
> **Structure:** This file contains the stack-independent collaboration contract and general architecture principles. The root `AGENTS.md` routes repository rules; `agent-rules/00-core/` contains global engineering invariants; and affected specialized `agent-rules/` modules contain concrete semantics.

